# A slide deck in 16:9 (Width: 960, Height: 540 in Page): one slide per page, each one a Block as tall as the page
# area (Height: 100%) that starts a new page (Before: page). The title slide is a section of its own, with a gradient
# background, no slide number and no footer of the deck (Inherit page overlays: false). The other slides are laid out
# with Grid: an Area map for the agenda, four key-figure tiles, a bar chart drawn with boxes whose Width is the
# percentage of each value, a table, a timeline whose phases span several quarters ("Area: 2 1 1 2") and a closing
# slide with a QR code to the deck. The footer, with the slide number of the total ({page} / {pages}), is a
# Page overlay of the document, and the accent strip at the left edge, another one with a negative Layer.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
